{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102663","id":2326497067,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Kq4cr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102663","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102663.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102663.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102663","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102663/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102663/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102663/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/fc631fc5c994c018a58fc7a696f2efd81373abce","number":102663,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add tab key moves focus to TextEdit","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Proposal: closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3050\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new option that lets you toggle the TextEdit/CodeEdit Tab trapping behavior. And a new shortcut to the Script/Shader editor to help out with keyboard navigation.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250208_205615](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4343288-76fb-4e07-8bf5-257092bf4cf7)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20250208_211344](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8614be22-c993-4264-b547-5404fcecab3d)\r\n\r\n## Editor\r\n\r\n### TextEdit\r\nFor TextEdit's used in the editor itself the setting has been set to true, going by this comment in the linked proposal:\r\n> ...as most people won't be entering code in TextEdit nodes in projects.\r\n\r\nBehavior can be changed by right clicking and changine the \"Tab Key Moves Focus\" option.\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250208_211957.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06866aac-6f7a-48a1-85de-25a80f29c957)\r\n\r\n## Script/Shader Editor\r\nA new shortcut has been added (default Ctrl+M, same as [VS Code uses](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/accessibility#_tab-trapping))\r\n\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250208_221144.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b295632-5e3f-4fbd-a22d-6dd18ddba9b7)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":